<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us &middot; ThoughtSpace</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1 class="brand">About the Creator</h1>
        <p>Hi, I'm Jainam - the creator of ThoughtSpace.</p>
        <p>This platform is my first web application, built from the ground up as a way to turn an idea into something real. It started as a personal project driven by curiosity and a genuine interest in building products that people can actually use - and it's grown into a platform where anyone can write, share, and connect through their ideas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
        <h2>Why I Built This</h2>
        <p>I wanted to create a space that makes it easy for people to express themselves without barriers - no complicated tools, no unnecessary friction, just a clean and simple platform to write and share your thoughts with the world.</p>
        <p>Every feature here was built with intention, and every decision was made with the user in mind. This project reflects not just my technical skills, but my approach to problem-solving and product design.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
        <h2>Just the Beginning</h2>
        <p>ThoughtSpace is my first web app, but it certainly won't be my last. This is the start of a journey, and there are many more projects on the way - each one built with the same care, curiosity, and attention to detail.</p>
        <p>I'm excited to keep learning, building, and creating tools that add real value to people's lives. Thank you for being part of this first chapter.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
        I'd love for you to explore what I've built and be part of this growing community. More is coming soon - stay tuned.

        <a href="#" class="cta-button">Connect With Me &rarr;</a>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>
</body>

</html>
